[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 39917.51, "timestamp": "11:05:17", "text": "嘿。是啊，这真的让人很焦虑，因为人们都在给我打电话，而我只能等着。我在做ginchin。  等等，你老板给"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39922.55, "timestamp": "11:05:22", "text": "你打电话了。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39930.79, "timestamp": "11:05:30", "text": "，快下车吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39937.83, "timestamp": "11:05:37", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39941.906, "timestamp": "11:05:41", "text": "我会处理的，巴。別生氣。別擔心。  別擔心。我打算"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39946.39, "timestamp": "11:05:46", "text": "用我"}]